{"unit_id":"JessenReinhart__dsh-snapcompact#card-zh","repo":"JessenReinhart/dsh-snapcompact","commit":"22c2d5714c656d863aa51fa3f12fd55d7c2e6029","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-snapcompact 是 DSH Web 客户端的上下文压缩插件，将较早的对话编码为 PNG 位图帧，并以检查点消息替换选定历史。它通过 CompactionEngine 服务和 /snapcompact 命令接入，支持手动归档、空闲自动压缩、上下文压力触发和超限恢复，可按模型选择帧形状并保留近期纯文本。适合希望减少长会话上下文占用、同时保留旧对话记录的用户。需要 DSH attachments、sessions、tokenMeter 和 commands 服务；原生渲染器路径 PI_NATIVES_PATH 可选。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:900-999","lib/index.js:1011-1080","lib/index.js:1135-1147"]}
{"unit_id":"JessenReinhart__dsh-snapcompact#card-en","repo":"JessenReinhart/dsh-snapcompact","commit":"22c2d5714c656d863aa51fa3f12fd55d7c2e6029","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-snapcompact compresses DSH session history into PNG frames, replacing it with a checkpoint. It offers manual and automatic compaction by service and chat command, keeping recent turns as text. It helps manage long sessions and needs DSH attachment, session, token meter, and command services.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:900-999","lib/index.js:1011-1080","lib/index.js:1135-1147"]}
