{"unit_id":"JessenReinhart__dsh-snapcompact#feature-1","repo":"JessenReinhart/dsh-snapcompact","commit":"22c2d5714c656d863aa51fa3f12fd55d7c2e6029","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-snapcompact 的功能「手动归档」：把选定的较早会话历史编码成 PNG 帧并用检查点替换。通过 /snapcompact 触发，可用 --frames、--shape 调整帧数与形状，也可用 --all 不保留最近纯文本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1243-1258","lib/index.js:967-999","lib/index.js:1011-1040"]}
{"unit_id":"JessenReinhart__dsh-snapcompact#feature-2","repo":"JessenReinhart/dsh-snapcompact","commit":"22c2d5714c656d863aa51fa3f12fd55d7c2e6029","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-snapcompact 的功能「空闲自动压缩」：在 agent 空闲、上下文用量超过阈值且达到最低 token 数时启动归档。可用 /snapcompact auto on、off 或 threshold 调整。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:756-807","lib/index.js:1160-1199"]}
{"unit_id":"JessenReinhart__dsh-snapcompact#feature-3","repo":"JessenReinhart/dsh-snapcompact","commit":"22c2d5714c656d863aa51fa3f12fd55d7c2e6029","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-snapcompact 的功能「自动压力处理」：可在 agent 步骤前按上下文压力尝试压缩，也会在收到上下文窗口超限错误时尝试归档并请求重试。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:809-827","lib/index.js:829-861"]}
{"unit_id":"JessenReinhart__dsh-snapcompact#feature-4","repo":"JessenReinhart/dsh-snapcompact","commit":"22c2d5714c656d863aa51fa3f12fd55d7c2e6029","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-snapcompact 的功能「按模型和文字选择帧形状」：归档时根据 provider、model 及文本中的宽字符选择对应的字体与网格，再渲染成 PNG 图像帧。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:221-239","lib/index.js:281-307","lib/index.js:959-985"]}
{"unit_id":"JessenReinhart__dsh-snapcompact#caveat-1","repo":"JessenReinhart/dsh-snapcompact","commit":"22c2d5714c656d863aa51fa3f12fd55d7c2e6029","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-snapcompact 使用 DSH attachments 服务保存图像帧，并把自动压缩偏好写入用户目录下的 snapcompact-config.json；DSH_HOME 可更改该目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:654-675","lib/index.js:987-999"]}
